{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|12DB9FFF4D701607465AFBB34BDC0E2E", "source_en": "I shall delight in the defilement of your corpse.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "سأستمتع بنجس جثتك!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|220698344A81533C222017A325709D08", "source_en": "You are a footnote in my people’s legacy!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "لستَ سوى هامشٍ في إرث شعبي!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|42AA14BE44F67D80731ED99B293E84AD", "source_en": "Akyreon will be avenged!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "سيُنتقم لأكيريون!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|51DFE8E342F8F72D2B2B4A9B679F1CDF", "source_en": "Soul torn Aether-Spawn approaches! ", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "يقترب كائن الأثير ذو الروح الممزقة!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|556018424F95D6916B4B3184DD9BA8BD", "source_en": "Enough of this!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "كفى!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|574722DC49F059A1E27A1F87B5729D42", "source_en": "You grace belies your weakness, wretch!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "نعمتك تخفي ضعفك، أيها الوضيع!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|57D83EB44E1E7CAE8F13B0B59F6EE82D", "source_en": "You’re worthy of your commander’s legacy.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "أنت تستحق إرث قائدك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|6E89FFBC49F1D7793581D39725D87858", "source_en": "*argh!* Your soul is tempered.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "*آآآه!* روحك صلبة كالفولاذ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|8BE931814ACFC86C60144993E8FDE20E", "source_en": "The Demiurge died for this?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "هل مات \"الديمورج\" من أجل هذا؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|A335DDDB491EAFFDE46F15BD1469B1D2", "source_en": "Submit to your demise, creature!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "استسلم لموتك، أيها المخلوق!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|A524C3CC4F46EF7618143690230BFE43", "source_en": "You wear his shadow!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "أنت تحمل ظله!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|AA996F494896A63F1BD47CA77C0BB0C3", "source_en": "To your coffin wretch!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "عُد إلى تابوتك، أيها البائس!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|AD686233422596EECC471E95468B79B8", "source_en": "You live and die for a lie.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "تعيش وتموت من أجل كذبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|AFBB079B4D2CACB5A9CC999C6CAC7F5B", "source_en": "Your blood is an abomination of the Astral tide.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "دمك رجسٌ من مدّ الأثير.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|CE41054042B4D7D5BD52EA9D3F30FB94", "source_en": "Cain’s Will be done!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "لتُنفذ إرادة كاين!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|E867A07F4405DD0C52A2179C0C61E903", "source_en": "Your Aeonic blood cannot protect you forever.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "دمك الأيوني لن يحميك للأبد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|E888FBB041068845D02263A9317FC5B2", "source_en": "My Legion! On me!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "فيلقي! اهجموا عليّ!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|F31D91C44A2778A1464D05836A91AE87", "source_en": "I am your doom!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "أنا هلاكك!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|F32EB3C1477ABDCF0100A6BC2305166C", "source_en": "You will die on your knees!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "ستموتُ جاثماً على ركبتيك!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|F5D3989442B12FD327FD5E875E47AF22", "source_en": "I’ve filled mounds with the corpses of greater men!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "لقد رصفتُ تلالاً من جثثِ رجالٍ أعظمَ منك!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Valahk|FBAD1279428D670E397178B22486F191", "source_en": "Where is your Commander?! You mock his legacy!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Valahk", "ar": "أين قائدُك؟! إنك تستهزئُ بإرثه!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 32}}
